-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §150: the salary determining the budgetary
-- pension of teaching employees who moved to the reform is the collective
-- agreement of 31.8.08's.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `base-agreement-common`
§ `150`

DECLARE `instrument` IS ONE OF `the pension agreement of 31.8.08`, `this agreement`

@ref akn:art_150
GIVEN `moved to the reform` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE `instrument`
DECIDE `what governs the determining salary in the budgetary pension` `moved to the reform` IS
    IF `moved to the reform` THEN JUST `the pension agreement of 31.8.08` ELSE NOTHING

#ASSERT `what governs the determining salary in the budgetary pension` TRUE EQUALS JUST `the pension agreement of 31.8.08`
